<title>CANADA: Canadian agriculture markets, firms closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Canadian agriculture markets, firms closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian agricultural markets will be closed Monday, May 19 to mark Queen Victoria's birthday.</p>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board, the Winnipeg Commodity Exchange, Manitoba Agriculture and Manitoba Pork will not issue cash and futures prices due to the Victoria Day long weekend, officials said.</p>
<p>Markets are scheduled to reopen on Tuesday, May 20.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
